              "text": "دانشجوها در یک پانسیون زندگی میکنند. Dâneshju-hâ dar yek pânsiyon zendegi mikonand. The students live in a boarding house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also meals included with a room: bâ pânsiyon — with full board."
