            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در شمال یک سوئیت کوچک اجاره کردیم. Dar shomâl yek su'it-e kuchek ejâre kardim. In the north we rented a small flat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "At the seaside in Iran a su'it is often a one-room holiday flat with a kitchen."
            }
          ]
